Package: model-management-tool
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: AI model management tool
 Desktop application built with Tauri for managing AI models.
 It supports importing local model files and directories, generating
 local model package layouts, validating and rendering editable model
 metadata, and downloading models from cloud repositories with resume
 support.
